# Normalise line endings on the way in, so a checkout on another platform does
# not produce a diff in every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# A shell script with CRLF line endings fails with a bare "bad interpreter",
# which names the shell rather than the endings and costs an hour.
*.sh      text eol=lf
Makefile  text eol=lf

# Generated or bulk content, kept out of the diff and the language statistics.
docs/adr/*.md linguist-documentation
